cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Citation metadata for KanuriSentiLex. Release identifiers and publication details will be added when available."
type: dataset
title: "KanuriSentiLex: A Polarity-Annotated Lexical Resource for Kanuri"
authors:
  - family-names: "Saleh"
    given-names: "Bashir Maina"
  - family-names: "Bilgaiyan"
    given-names: "Saurabh"
  - family-names: "Sagnika"
    given-names: "Santwana"
abstract: >
  A polarity-annotated inventory of 2,602 Kanuri lexical items developed
  using corpus-derived, translation-projected, and contextual sentiment
  signals. A stratified 400-item subset was independently annotated by
  three native speakers. This repository initially contains documentation;
  data and original experimental implementation remain to be added.
keywords:
  - Kanuri
  - sentiment lexicon
  - low-resource languages
  - cross-lingual NLP
  - lexical resources
